        </li>
    </forcedTraitsChance>
    <skillGains>
        <Crafting>2</Crafting>
        <Intellectual>1</Intellectual>
    </skillGains>
    <baseDesc>[PAWN_nameDef] was always searching for hidden treasures and useful scraps. Growing up in a scavenger Kindred, [PAWN_pronoun] learned to find value in discarded items. [PAWN_pronoun] worked tirelessly to repurpose old machinery and scrap metal, transforming them into tools and weapons. This diligent work ethic made [PAWN_pronoun] a vital member of the community, always finding a way to make something from nothing.</baseDesc>
</AlienRace.BackstoryDef>

<AlienRace.BackstoryDef>
